    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>Recognition that <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g\"></span> is the gradient of the tangent line at 15 Mm ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g = \\frac{Δ {V}_{g}}{Δ r} = \\frac{70 \\, M J \\, {k g}^{- 1}}{12 \\, M m} = - 6.0 \\, N \\, {k g}^{- 1}\"></span> ✓ <br/>Accept range 5–7 N kg<sup>–1</sup>.</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.i\"><p><strong>b.i</strong></p><p>1.4 Mm ✓ <br/>Allow 1.35–1.45 Mm.</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.ii\"><p><strong>b.ii</strong></p><p>Recognition that this is from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V=-94\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V=-38\"></span> OR <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Δ V = 56 \\, M J {\\, k g}^{- 1}\"></span> ✓<br/><br/> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m = \\frac{W}{Δ V} = \\frac{8.1 \\times  {10}^{10}}{56 \\times  {10}^{6}} = 1446 \\, k g = 1400 \\, k g\"></span> ✓ <br/>MP1 allow ΔV = 54−56 MJ kg<sup>−1</sup>. Allow ECF for MP2.</p></section>"
